evolutionized the narcotics trade during the Vietnam War by cutting out the middleman and buying directly from the Golden Triangle. His logistical genius involved a smuggling route so grisly that many investigators initially dismissed it as a myth. He utilized the tragic, constant flow of fallen US soldiers returning home to transport high-purity \"Blue Magic\" heroin into the country. He bypassed every customs check in the world by hiding the shipments in a specific, morbid location that no inspector dared to disturb, essentially using the \"honored dead\" as his personal courier service.  Where were the drugs hidden?", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-04-29T15:43:49Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Anus?", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]